requirements.detail:
Tablets must comply with the strict statistical acceptance parameters of Table 3 under Clause 5.1.2.6 across S1, S2, and S3 testing stages: 
a) Stage S1 (6 units tested): Each individual value shall be not less than Q + 5 percent; 
b) Stage S2 (6 units tested, 12 cumulative): Average value of 12 units (S1 + S2) must be equal to or greater than Q, and no single unit can be less than Q - 15 percent; 
c) Stage S3 (24 units tested, 36 cumulative): Average value of 24 units (S1 + S2 + S3) must be equal to or greater than Q, not more than two units can be less than Q - 15 percent, and no single unit can be less than Q - 25 percent.
